		<title>Nvidia halts server shipments to Malaysia, Singapore, Thailand, and Indonesia after tighter US export controls</title>
		<link>https://the-decoder.com/nvidia-halts-server-shipments-to-malaysia-singapore-thailand-and-indonesia-after-tighter-us-export-controls/</link>
					<comments>https://the-decoder.com/nvidia-halts-server-shipments-to-malaysia-singapore-thailand-and-indonesia-after-tighter-us-export-controls/#respond</comments>
		
